t-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1226125435="" id="message-content-id-r_08e405fadb5ec234" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1226125435="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_08e405fadb5ec234" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">ExtJS 4 的组件库确实非常庞大（总数有好几百个类），直接罗列所有类名既枯燥也记不住。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">为了方便你学习，我按照**“功能分类”**为你整理了开发中最常用的核心组件。<b>请重点记忆括号里的 <code>xtype</code></b>，因为在实际写代码（尤其是 MVC 模式）时，我们通常使用 <code>xtype</code> 字符串来引用组件，而不是写很长的类名。</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><p data-path-to-node="3"></p><h3>1. 顶级容器类 (Top-Level Containers)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="4">这些通常是页面的“骨架”或“容器”。</p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c1137322339="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" class="table-block has-export-button has-scrollbar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="5"><table data-path-to-node="5"><thead><tr><td data-path-to-node="5,0,0,0">组件名称</td><td data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0">类名 (<code>Ext.class</code>)</td><td data-path-to-node="5,0,2,0">xtype (别名)</td><td data-path-to-node="5,0,3,0">描述</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-path-to-node="5,1,0,0"><b>视口</b></td><td data-path-to-node="5,1,1,0"><code>Ext.container.Viewport</code></td><td data-path-to-node="5,1,2,0"><code>viewport</code></td><td data-path-to-node="5,1,3,0"><b>整个浏览器窗口</b>。页面加载时会自动铺满全屏，通常作为最外层容器。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="5,2,0,0"><b>窗口</b></td><td data-path-to-node="5,2,1,0"><code>Ext.window.Window</code></td><td data-path-to-node="5,2,2,0"><code>window</code></td><td data-path-to-node="5,2,3,0"><b>浮动弹窗</b>。可以拖动、最大化、模态（遮罩）。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="5,3,0,0"><b>面板</b></td><td data-path-to-node="5,3,1,0"><code>Ext.panel.Panel</code></td><td data-path-to-node="5,3,2,0"><code>panel</code></td><td data-path-to-node="5,3,3,0"><b>最基础的容器</b>。带有标题栏（Header）、工具栏（Toolbar）和边框。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="5,4,0,0"><b>表单面板</b></td><td data-path-to-node="5,4,1,0"><code>Ext.form.Panel</code></td><td data-path-to-node="5,4,2,0"><code>form</code></td><td data-path-to-node="5,4,3,0">专门用于包裹表单字段的面板，拥有 <code>submit</code> 和 <code>load</code> 方法。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy table" aria-label="Copy table" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_08e405fadb5ec234&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,1]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><hr data-path-to-node="6"><p data-path-to-node="7"></p><h3>2. 数据展示类 (Data Presentation)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="8">这是 ExtJS 最强大的地方，用于展示复杂数据。</p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c1137322339="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" class="table-block has-export-button"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="7"><table data-path-to-node="9"><thead><tr><td data-path-to-node="9,0,0,0">组件名称</td><td data-path-to-node="9,0,1,0">类名 (<code>Ext.class</code>)</td><td data-path-to-node="9,0,2,0">xtype (别名)</td><td data-path-to-node="9,0,3,0">描述</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-path-to-node="9,1,0,0"><b>表格</b></td><td data-path-to-node="9,1,1,0"><code>Ext.grid.Panel</code></td><td data-path-to-node="9,1,2,0"><code>grid</code> / <code>gridpanel</code></td><td data-path-to-node="9,1,3,0"><b>核心组件</b>。用于展示二维数据，支持排序、分页、编辑。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="9,2,0,0"><b>树</b></td><td data-path-to-node="9,2,1,0"><code>Ext.tree.Panel</code></td><td data-path-to-node="9,2,2,0"><code>treepanel</code></td><td data-path-to-node="9,2,3,0">用于展示层级数据（文件夹结构）。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="9,3,0,0"><b>数据视图</b></td><td data-path-to-node="9,3,1,0"><code>Ext.view.View</code></td><td data-path-to-node="9,3,2,0"><code>dataview</code></td><td data-path-to-node="9,3,3,0">用于自定义模板展示数据（例如电商图片列表），比 Grid 更灵活但代码量大。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy table" aria-label="Copy table" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_08e405fadb5ec234&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,1]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><hr data-path-to-node="10"><p data-path-to-node="11"></p><h3>3. 表单输入字段 (Form Fields)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="12">放在 <code>Ext.form.Panel</code> 里面的控件，用于用户输入。</p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c1137322339="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" class="table-block has-export-button has-scrollbar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="9"><table data-path-to-node="13"><thead><tr><td data-path-to-node="13,0,0,0">组件名称</td><td data-path-to-node="13,0,1,0">类名 (<code>Ext.form.field.*</code>)</td><td data-path-to-node="13,0,2,0">xtype (别名)</td><td data-path-to-node="13,0,3,0">描述</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-path-to-node="13,1,0,0"><b>文本框</b></td><td data-path-to-node="13,1,1,0"><code>Text</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,1,2,0"><code>textfield</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,1,3,0">单行文本输入。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="13,2,0,0"><b>数字框</b></td><td data-path-to-node="13,2,1,0"><code>Number</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,2,2,0"><code>numberfield</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,2,3,0">只能输入数字，支持微调按钮。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="13,3,0,0"><b>日期框</b></td><td data-path-to-node="13,3,1,0"><code>Date</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,3,2,0"><code>datefield</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,3,3,0">带有日历下拉选择器。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="13,4,0,0"><b>下拉框</b></td><td data-path-to-node="13,4,1,0"><code>ComboBox</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,4,2,0"><code>combo</code> / <code>combobox</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,4,3,0"><b>非常常用</b>。支持自动补全、远程加载选项。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="13,5,0,0"><b>多行文本</b></td><td data-path-to-node="13,5,1,0"><code>TextArea</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,5,2,0"><code>textareafield</code> / <code>textarea</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,5,3,0">备注类长文本输入。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="13,6,0,0"><b>复选框</b></td><td data-path-to-node="13,6,1,0"><code>Checkbox</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,6,2,0"><code>checkbox</code></td><td data-path-to-node="13,6,3,0">多选打钩。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-