de="17,3,3,0">比 Panel 更轻量，没有标题栏和边框，仅仅为了通过布局（Layout）来排列子元素。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy table" aria-label="Copy table" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_08e405fadb5ec234&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,1]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><hr data-path-to-node="18"><p data-path-to-node="19"></p><h3>5. 工具栏与菜单 (Bars &amp; Menus)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="20">通常配置在 Panel 的 <code>tbar</code> (top bar) 或 <code>bbar</code> (bottom bar) 中。</p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c1137322339="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" class="table-block has-export-button has-scrollbar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="13"><table data-path-to-node="21"><thead><tr><td data-path-to-node="21,0,0,0">组件名称</td><td data-path-to-node="21,0,1,0">类名</td><td data-path-to-node="21,0,2,0">xtype (别名)</td><td data-path-to-node="21,0,3,0">描述</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-path-to-node="21,1,0,0"><b>工具栏</b></td><td data-path-to-node="21,1,1,0"><code>Ext.toolbar.Toolbar</code></td><td data-path-to-node="21,1,2,0"><code>toolbar</code></td><td data-path-to-node="21,1,3,0">放置按钮的条状区域。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="21,2,0,0"><b>分页条</b></td><td data-path-to-node="21,2,1,0"><code>Ext.toolbar.Paging</code></td><td data-path-to-node="21,2,2,0"><code>pagingtoolbar</code></td><td data-path-to-node="21,2,3,0">Grid 底部常见的分页控制器（上一页、下一页）。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="21,3,0,0"><b>按钮</b></td><td data-path-to-node="21,3,1,0"><code>Ext.button.Button</code></td><td data-path-to-node="21,3,2,0"><code>button</code></td><td data-path-to-node="21,3,3,0">标准按钮。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="21,4,0,0"><b>文字项</b></td><td data-path-to-node="21,4,1,0"><code>Ext.toolbar.TextItem</code></td><td data-path-to-node="21,4,2,0"><code>tbtext</code></td><td data-path-to-node="21,4,3,0">工具栏上的纯文字。</td></tr><tr><td data-path-to-node="21,5,0,0"><b>填充项</b></td><td data-path-to-node="21,5,1,0"><code>Ext.toolbar.Fill</code></td><td data-path-to-node="21,5,2,0"><code>tbfill</code></td><td data-path-to-node="21,5,3,0">将右侧的按钮挤到最右边的占位符。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy table" aria-label="Copy table" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_08e405fadb5ec234&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,1]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><hr data-path-to-node="22"><p data-path-to-node="23"></p><h3>6. 常用工具类 (Utilities)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="24">这些不是配置在 <code>items</code> 里的组件，而是直接调用的功能。</p><ul data-path-to-node="25"><li><p data-path-to-node="25,0,0"><b><code>Ext.Msg</code> (MessageBox)</b>: 类似于 <code>alert</code> 或 <code>confirm</code>，但是是美化过的 ExtJS 风格。</p><ul data-path-to-node="25,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="25,0,1,0,0"><code>Ext.Msg.alert('标题', '内容')</code></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="25,0,1,1,0"><code>Ext.Msg.confirm('确认', '你确定删除吗?', callback)</code></p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="25,1,0"><b><code>Ext.tip.ToolTip</code></b>: 鼠标悬停提示。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="26"><p data-path-to-node="27"></p><h3>学习建议</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="28">你不需要一下子背下所有组件。在 ExtJS 4 开发中，<b>80% 的时间你都在跟以下三个组件打交道</b>：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="29"><li><p data-path-to-node="29,0,0"><b><code>gridpanel</code></b> (表格)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,1,0"><b><code>form</code></b> (表单)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,2,0"><b><code>window</code></b> (弹窗)</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="30"><b>接下来的学习步骤：</b>
