ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c1226125435="" id="message-content-id-r_549e435b6264093b" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1226125435="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_549e435b6264093b" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 600ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">ExtJS 4 的布局系统（Layouts）是它最强大但也最容易让初学者“头秃”的地方。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">简单来说，<b>Layout 决定了容器（Container）内部的子组件（Items）如何排列、以及如何自动计算宽度和高度。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="2">如果不配置 Layout，ExtJS 默认只是把组件像积木一样堆在那里，不会自动撑满，也不会自动对齐。</p><p data-path-to-node="3">以下是 ExtJS 4 中开发最常用的 <b>5 种核心布局</b>，掌握这些就能应对 90% 的场景。</p><hr data-path-to-node="4"><p data-path-to-node="5"></p><h3>1. Border 布局 (边界布局)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="6"><b>用途：</b> 几乎所有的<b>后台管理系统主界面</b>都是用它搭建的。
<b>特点：</b> 它把空间切分为 5 个区域：<code>north</code> (上), <code>south</code> (下), <code>east</code> (右), <code>west</code> (左), <code>center</code> (中)。</p><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b>必须规则</b>：必须有一个 <code>region: 'center'</code>，它会自动填满剩余的所有空间。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b>常用配置</b>：<code>collapsible: true</code> (允许折叠侧边栏)，<code>split: true</code> (允许拖拽调整宽度)。</p></li></ul><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-38 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-38 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_549e435b6264093b&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_caeb9640c8d6e4de&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahcKEwjV3rLI7YWRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQKA" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-38 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-38">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-38 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-38 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_549e435b6264093b&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_caeb9640c8d6e4de&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-m