}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><ul data-path-to-node="8"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><b>优点</b>：不需要写额外的 CSS 文件，立竿见影。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"><b>缺点</b>：只能改文字，改不了按钮背景色。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="9"><p data-path-to-node="10"></p><h3>方法二：CSS 类名法（修改背景色 - <b>最推荐</b>）</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="11">如果你想把按钮变成红色（比如“删除”按钮），你需要使用 <code>cls</code> 属性，并且在 CSS 中<b>去掉 ExtJS 默认的背景图</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="12"><b>1. 定义 CSS (在你的 .css 文件或 <code>&lt;style&gt;</code> 标签中)</b>
注意：必须写 <code>background-image: none</code>，否则 ExtJS 默认的蓝色渐变背景图会挡住你的红色。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-70 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-70 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_04a29d8f2f82801c&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_0d6fc562ba6151ce&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahcKEwjV3rLI7YWRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQTw" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-70 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-70">CSS</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-70 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-70 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_04a29d8f2f82801c&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_0d6fc562ba6151ce&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2179167942-70"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2179167942-70"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-70"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2179167942-70"><span class="hljs-comment">/* 自定义红色按钮样式 */</span>
<span class="hljs-selector-class">.my-red-btn</span> {
    <span class="hljs-attribute">background-image</span>: none <span class="hljs-meta">!important</span>; <span class="hljs-comment">/* 去掉默认渐变图 */</span>
    <span class="hljs-attribute">background-color</span>: <span class="hljs-number">#ff4d4f</span> <span class="hljs-meta">!important</span>; <span class="hljs-comment">/* 设置背景色 */</span>
    <span class="hljs-attribute">border-color</span>: <span class="hljs-number">#ff4d4f</span> <span class="hljs-meta">!important</span>;     <span class="hljs-comment">/* 设置边框色 */</span>
}

<span class="hljs-comment">/* 鼠标悬停时的样式 (可选) */</span>
<span class="hljs-selector-class">.my-red-btn</span><span class="hljs-selector-pseudo">:hover</span> {
