> 是通用的，而 <code>Controller</code> 才是企业级开发的标准写法。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="2">我来把这三种方式拆解开讲清楚。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><p data-path-to-node="4"></p><h3>1. <code>handler</code> (专用快捷方式)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="5">这是最简单的写法，<b>只对 Button（按钮）有效</b>。它是“点击事件”的快捷方式。</p><ul data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b>适用场景</b>：写 Demo、测试功能、或者极其简单的弹窗按钮。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b>缺点</b>：逻辑代码和界面代码混在一起（紧耦合），代码多了以后很难维护。</p></li></ul><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-93 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-93 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6d9ad346e1535517&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_813e867a18e1bf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahcKEwjV3rLI7YWRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQbg" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-93 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-93">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-93 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-93 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6d9ad346e1535517&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_813e867a18e1bf9a&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2179167942-93"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2179167942-93"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-93"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2179167942-93">Ext.create(<span class="hljs-string">'Ext.button.Button'</span>, {
