v _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c636883080-99 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c636883080-99"><button _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c636883080-99 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c636883080-99"><span _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-99">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c636883080-99"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c636883080-99 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1226125435="" id="message-content-id-r_597e7be3c3c1e937" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1226125435="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_597e7be3c3c1e937" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">太棒了。在 ExtJS 开发中，<b>Store（数据仓库）</b> 和 <b>Proxy（代理）</b> 是数据流动的核心。如果你理解了这一块，你就打通了前端界面（Grid/Form）和后端数据库（Spring/Java）之间的“任督二脉”。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">我们可以把这个过程想象成一家<b>超市</b>：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b>Grid (表格/界面)</b>：是<b>货架</b>，负责把商品展示给顾客看。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b>Store (仓库)</b>：是<b>超市仓库</b>，负责暂存商品数据。Grid 的数据直接来源于 Store。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><b>Proxy (物流卡车)</b>：是<b>运输队</b>，负责去“工厂”（后端 API）拉货，并运回“仓库”（Store）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,3,0"><b>Model (商品规格书)</b>：定义了商品长什么样（有哪些字段，比如 id, name, price）。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="3"><p data-path-to-node="4"></p><h3>第一步：定义 Model (定义数据模型)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="5">首先，我们要告诉 ExtJS，我们要处理的数据有哪些字段。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-122 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-122 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_597e7be3c3c1e937&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_7b9ce2485f482899&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjV3rLI7YWRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQiwE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-122 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-122">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-122 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-122 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripp