数据量少的时候一次性加载没问题，但如果后台有 1 万条数据，你需要做**“分页查询”**（Pagination）。ExtJS 的分页条（PagingToolbar）非常强大，但需要前后端配合。</p><p data-path-to-node="31">你想看<b>前端如何配置分页</b>，以及<b>发给后台的参数（limit, page, start）长什么样</b>吗？</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" _nghost-ng-c3711665544="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1330069915="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1330069915-97"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3862268828="" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-113 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3862268828-113 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3862268828-113 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-113"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-113"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c3492214941="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3492214941="" class="conversation-container message-actions