36883080="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c636883080-130 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c636883080-130"><button _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c636883080-130 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c636883080-130"><span _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-130">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c636883080-130"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c636883080-130 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1226125435="" id="message-content-id-r_5483dcf6eb0f1ebc" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1226125435="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_5483dcf6eb0f1ebc" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常经典且令人头疼的 ExtJS 4 问题。当你发现点击一次按钮，Network 里却飞出去两个一样的 Ajax 请求时，通常是以下 <b>3 种原因</b> 造成的。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">请按顺序排查，概率由高到低：</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><p data-path-to-node="3"></p><h3>原因一：View 和 Controller 重复监听 (最常见 🎯)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="4">这是新手最容易犯的错误。你可能在 <b>View（界面文件）</b> 里写了一遍 <code>handler</code>，然后又在 <b>Controller（控制器）</b> 里写了一遍 <code>control</code>。</p><p data-path-to-node="5"><b>❌ 错误代码示例：</b></p><p data-path-to-node="6"><b>View (app/view/user/List.js):</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-153 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-153 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5483dcf6eb0f1ebc&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_568b80a2f7c6b5dc&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjV3rLI7YWRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrgE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-153 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-153">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-153 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-153 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5483dcf6eb0f1ebc&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_568b80a2f7c6b5dc&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2179167942-153"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2179167942-153"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-153"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2179167942-153">{
    <span class="hljs-attr">xtype</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'button'</span>,
