"24,3,2,0">自动生成 <code>getXXX()</code> 方法，方便获取组件实例</td><td data-path-to-node="24,3,3,0">快捷键：“把那个人存进通讯录，下次直接按 1 键就能找到他，不用再去街上找”。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy table" aria-label="Copy table" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_7a6b35cf86b87699&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1137322339="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><p data-path-to-node="25"></p><h3>最佳实践建议</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="26">在 ExtJS 4 的实际开发中，标准的流程是：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="27"><li><p data-path-to-node="27,0,0"><b>View</b>：定义好组件，记得给关键组件写上 <code>alias: 'widget.xxx'</code> (定义 xtype) 或者 <code>action: 'xxx'</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="27,1,0"><b>Controller</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="27,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="27,1,1,0,0">用 <code>refs</code> 为常用的组件（如主 Grid、编辑 Form Window）创建引用，方便你在代码里随时获取它们。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="27,1,1,1,0">用 <code>control</code> 监听按钮点击或表格选中事件。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="27,1,1,2,0">在事件处理函数中，调用 <code>this.getXXX()</code> (由 refs 生成) 来获取组件，然后操作数据。</p></li></ul></li></ol></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" _nghost-ng-c3711665544="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1330069915="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1330069915-159"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3862268828="" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-167 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3862268828-167 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3862268828-167 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-167"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-167"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c3492214941="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3492214941="" class="convers