s _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-176 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c636883080-176 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c636883080-176"><button _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c636883080-176 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c636883080-176"><span _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-176">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c636883080-176"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c636883080-176 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1226125435="" id="message-content-id-r_18e44f572c8a0052" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1226125435="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_18e44f572c8a0052" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常棒的实战请求。光看概念不如写代码。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">为了让你彻底理解 <b>View（界面）</b> 和 <b>Controller（逻辑）</b> 是如何配合的，我们来开发一个最经典的场景：<b>“用户列表页”</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">这个页面包含：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b>View</b>：一个展示用户的表格（Grid），上面有一个搜索框和一个“搜索”按钮。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b>Controller</b>：监听“搜索”按钮的点击事件，获取输入框的值，并过滤表格数据。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="4">我们将按照 <b>标准的 ExtJS 4 MVC 开发流程</b> 一步步来。</p><hr data-path-to-node="5"><p data-path-to-node="6"></p><h3>准备工作：文件目录结构</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="7">假设你的项目名字叫 <code>MyApp</code>。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-199 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-199 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_18e44f572c8a0052&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_e6e1175310bc9886&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjV3rLI7YWRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ6gE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-199 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-199">Plaintext</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-199 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-199 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-