现在我们只能看数据。你想不想给这个页面加一个**“新增用户”<b>的功能？这需要创建一个</b>弹窗 (Window)** 并涉及 View 之间的数据传递。需要我继续往下写吗？</p></div><!----></message-content><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" _nghost-ng-c3711665544="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1330069915="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1330069915-174"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3862268828="" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-190 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3862268828-190 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" class="spacer ng-tns-c3862268828-190 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-190"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c3862268828="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c3862268828-190"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c3492214941="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3492214941="" class="conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted" id="4c2a8e9495435ebf" style=""><user-query _ngcontent-ng-c34922