on="" mattooltip="More" tabindex="0" aria-label="Show more options" data-test-id="more-menu-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button more-button ng-tns-c1330069915-205 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-19" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1330069915="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="response-content ng-tns-c1330069915-205"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-207 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c636883080-207 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c636883080-207"><button _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c636883080-207 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c636883080-207"><span _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-207">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c636883080-207"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c636883080-207 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1226125435="" id="message-content-id-r_4c2a8e9495435ebf" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1226125435="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_4c2a8e9495435ebf" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常经典的需求，在 ExtJS 4 中，这种“左边输入框，右边按钮，点按钮弹窗选择”的组件，官方术语叫 <b>Trigger Field</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">我们要开发的自定义组件 <code>CodeViewX</code> 将继承自 <code>Ext.form.field.Trigger</code>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2"></p><h3>设计思路</h3><p></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b>继承 (<code>extend</code>)</b>：继承 <code>Ext.form.field.Trigger</code>，它自带文本框和右侧的触发按钮布局。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b>样式 (<code>triggerCls</code>)</b>：使用 ExtJS 自带的搜索图标样式 (<code>x-form-search-trigger</code>)。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,2,0"><b>事件 (<code>onTriggerClick</code>)</b>：重写这个方法，点击时创建 Store (Ajax) 和 Window。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,3,0"><b>弹窗内容</b>：虽然你说“表单”，但“选择多行两列的内容”通常指的是 <b>Grid (表格)</b>。如果是单纯的 Form 表单通常用于录入而非选择。我将为你实现一个<b>带有两列数据的 Grid 选择器</b>。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="4"><p data-path-to-node="5"></p><h3>1. 组件源码 (<code>MyApp.view.component.CodeViewX.js</code>)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="6">你可以把这段代码放在 <code>app/view/component/CodeViewX.js</code> 文件中。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-221 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-221 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_4c2a8e9495435ebf&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_7f90ca57e9021234&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjV3rLI7YWRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQggI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-221 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-221">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-221 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-221 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_4c2a8e9495435ebf&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_7f90ca57e9021234&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2179167942-221"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2179167942-221"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-221"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2179167942-221">Ext.define(<span class="hljs-string">'MyApp.view.component.CodeViewX'</span>, {
    <span class="hljs-attr">extend</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'Ext.form.field.Trigger'</span>, <span class="hljs-comment">// 继承触发器字段</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">alias</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'widget.codeviewx'</span>,        <span class="hljs-comment">// 定义 xtype</span>

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 配置右侧按钮的图标（放大镜）</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">triggerCls</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'x-form-search-trigger'</span>, 

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 可配置参数：后台接口地址</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">url</span>: <span class="hljs-string">''</span>, 
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 可配置参数：弹窗标题</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">windowTitle</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'请选择数据'</span>,

    <span class="hljs-attr">initComponent</span>: <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) </span>{
        <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.callParent(<span class="hljs-built_in">arguments</span>);
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 注册一个自定义事件，方便 Controller 监听选择后的动作</span>
        <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.addEvents(<span class="hljs-string">'itemselected'</span>);
    },

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 重写点击右侧按钮的事件</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">onTriggerClick</span>: <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) </span>{
        <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> me = <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>;

        <span class="hljs-comment">// --- A. 定义临时 Store (负责 Ajax 请求) ---</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> store = Ext.create(<span class="hljs-string">'Ext.data.Store'</span>, {
            <span class="hljs-attr">fields</span>: [<span class="hljs-string">'code'</span>, <span class="hljs-string">'name'</span>], <span class="hljs-comment">// 假设后台返回这两列</span>
            <span class="hljs-attr">autoLoad</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>, <span class="hljs-comment">// 弹窗打开即请求</span>
            <span class="hljs-attr">proxy</span>: {
                <span class="hljs-attr">type</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'ajax'</span>,
                <span class="hljs-attr">url</span>: me.url || <span class="hljs-string">'/api/default/data'</span>, <span class="hljs-comment">// 使用配置的URL</span>
                <span class="hljs-attr">reader</span>: {
                    <span class="hljs-attr">type</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'json'</span>,
                    <span class="hljs-attr">root</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'data'</span>
                }
            }
        });

        <span class="hljs-comment">// --- B. 创建 Grid (用于展示两列多行数据) ---</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> grid = Ext.create(<span class="hljs-string">'Ext.grid.Panel'</span>, {
            <span class="hljs-attr">store</span>: store,
            <span class="hljs-attr">border</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">columns</span>: [
                { <span class="hljs-attr">text</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'编码 (Code)'</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">dataIndex</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'code'</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">flex</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1</span> },
                { <span class="hljs-attr">text</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'名称 (Name)'</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">dataIndex</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'name'</span>, <span class="hljs-attr">flex</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1</span> }
            ],
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 监听双击行事件</span>
            <span class="hljs-attr">listeners</span>: {
                <span class="hljs-attr">itemdblclick</span>: <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span>(<span class="hljs-params">view, record</span>) </span>{
                    me.handleSelect(win, record);
                }
            }
        });

        <span class="hljs-comment">// --- C. 创建弹窗 Window ---</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> win = Ext.create(<span class="hljs-string">'Ext.window.Window'</span>, {
            <span class="hljs-attr">title</span>: me.windowTitle,
            <span class="hljs-attr">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">500</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">height</span>: <span class="hljs-number">400</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">layout</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'fit'</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">modal</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>, <span class="hljs-comment">// 模态窗口，遮罩背后</span>
            <span class="hljs-attr">items</span>: [grid],
            <span class="hljs-attr">buttons</span>: [
                {
                    <span class="hljs-attr">text</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'确定'</span>,
                    <span class="hljs-attr">handler</span>: <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) </span>{
                        <span class="hljs-comment">// 获取选中的行</span>
                        <span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> selection = grid.getSelectionModel().getSelection();
                        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (selection.length &gt; <span class="hljs-number">0</span>) {
                            me.handleSelect(win, selection[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>]);
                        } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
                            Ext.Msg.alert(<span class="hljs-string">'提示'</span>, <span class="hljs-string">'请先选择一行数据'</span>);
                        }
                    }
                },
                {
                    <span class="hljs-attr">text</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'取消'</span>,
                    <span class="hljs-attr">handler</span>: <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) </span>{
                        win.close();
                    }
                }
            ]
        });

        win.show();
    },

    <span class="hljs-comment">// --- D. 处理选择逻辑 ---</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">handleSelect</span>: <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span>(<span class="hljs-params">win, record</span>) </span>{
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 将选中的值赋给当前文本框</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 假设我们要把 'name' 显示在文本框里</span>
        <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.setValue(record.get(<span class="hljs-string">'name'</span>)); 

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. (可选) 如果你想保存 code 而显示 name，可以存到 extra 属性里</span>
        <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.selectedCode = record.get(<span class="hljs-string">'code'</span>);

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 触发自定义事件，给 Controller 用</span>
        <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>.fireEvent(<span class="hljs-string">'itemselected'</span>, <span class="hljs-built_in">this</span>, record);

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 4. 关闭窗口</span>
        win.close();
    }
});
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="8"><p data-path-to-node="9"></p><h3>2. 如何在页面中使用它</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="10">现在你可以在任何 Form Panel 或者 Grid Editor 中使用 <code>xtype: 'codeviewx'</code>。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-222 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-222 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_4c2a8e9495435ebf&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_7f90ca57e9021234&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjV3rLI7YWRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQgwI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-222 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-222">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-222 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-222 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&q