 data-test-id="more-menu-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button more-button ng-tns-c1330069915-224 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-19" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1330069915="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="response-content ng-tns-c1330069915-224"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-226 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c636883080-226 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c636883080-226"><button _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c636883080-226 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c636883080-226"><span _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="ng-tns-c636883080-226">Show thinking</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c636883080-226"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c636883080="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c636883080-226 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----><!----><!----><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c535586177="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c1226125435="" id="message-content-id-r_079b7d0267749114" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1226125435="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_079b7d0267749114" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">太好了。将自定义组件集成到 MVC Controller 中，是体现 ExtJS 架构优势的最佳实践。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">这样做最大的好处是：<b>你的 <code>CodeViewX</code> 组件只负责“选数据”这一件事，它完全不知道页面上还有什么“联系人”、“电话”字段。</b> 是 <b>Controller</b> 在中间穿针引线，负责把选中的数据填到其他输入框里。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">下面我们模拟一个业务场景：
<b>场景描述</b>：在一个“订单录入”表单中，使用 <code>codeviewx</code> 选择“供应商”。选中后，自动将该供应商的<b>联系人</b>和<b>电话</b>填充到表单的其他文本框中。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><p data-path-to-node="4"></p><h3>第一步：准备 View (表单视图)</h3><p></p><p data-path-to-node="5">我们在表单里放置我们的自定义组件 <code>codeviewx</code>，以及两个普通的文本框。</p><p data-path-to-node="6"><i>文件：<code>app/view/order/Form.js</code></i></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-243 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2179167942-243 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_079b7d0267749114&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1870234defa87c57&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjV3rLI7YWRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQnAI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2179167942-243 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-243">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2179167942-243 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" aria-label="Copy code" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Copy code" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2179167942-243 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_079b7d0267749114&quot;,&quot;c_0bc7eac89b122205&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1870234defa87c57&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2179167942-243"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2179167942-243"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" class="ng-tns-c2179167942-243"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2179167942="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2179167942-243">Ext.define(<span class="hljs-string">'MyApp.view.order.Form'</span>, {
    <span class="hljs-attr">extend</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'Ext.form.Panel'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-attr">alias</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'widget.orderform'</span>, <span class="hljs-comment">// 【关键】定义别名，供 Controller 选择</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">title</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'新建订单'</span>,
    <span class="hljs-attr">bodyPadding</span>: <span class="hljs-number">10</span>,
    <span class="hljs-attr">width</span>: <span class="hljs-number">500</span>,

    <span class="hljs-attr">items</span>: [
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 我们的自定义组件</span>
        {
            <span class="hljs-attr">xtype</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'codeviewx'</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">name</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'supplierName'</span>, <span class="hljs-comment">// 表单提交时的字段名</span>
            <span class="hljs-attr">fieldLabel</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'选择供应商'</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">anchor</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'100%'</span>,
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 自定义配置</span>
            <span class="hljs-attr">url</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'/api/suppliers'</span>, 
            <span class="hljs-attr">windowTitle</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'请选择供应商'</span>
        },
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 需要自动填充的字段</span>
        {
            <span class="hljs-attr">xtype</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'textfield'</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">name</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'contact'</span>, <span class="hljs-comment">// 联系人</span>
            <span class="hljs-attr">fieldLabel</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'联系人'</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">readOnly</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>,  <span class="hljs-comment">// 设为只读，表示自动带出</span>
            <span class="hljs-attr">anchor</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'100%'</span>
        },
        {
            <span class="hljs-attr">xtype</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'textfield'</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">name</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'phone'</span>,   <span class="hljs-comment">// 电话</span>
            <span class="hljs-attr">fieldLabel</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'联系电话'</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">readOnly</span>: <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">anchor</span>: <span class="hljs-string">'100%'</span>
        }
    ]
});
